                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Noten, S.; Stoop, A.; De Witte, J.; Landeweer, E.; Vinckers, F.; Hovenga, N.; van Boekel, L.C.; Luijkx, K.G. “Precious Time Together Was Taken Away”: Impact of COVID-19 Restrictive Measures on Social Needs and Loneliness from the Perspective of Residents of Nursing Homes, Close Relatives, and Volunteers. Int. J. Environ. Res. Public Health 2022, 19, 3468. https://doi.org/10.3390/ijerph19063468"
